{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Even now, according to your words, so it is.</b> Although the matter is now exactly as you said — given that the goblet is the ruler's goblet, which he repaid you with kindness by returning your money, each man to his sack — nevertheless, the man with whom it is found shall be my servant, and not all of you; and he too shall not die, as strict justice would have required." "<b>And you shall be clear.</b> From bondage and from any other punishment."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:30.583735146Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}